**controller_input.cpp does controller runtime setup and gamepad activity bridging.**

## Interface

`is_controller_active() -> bool`, `should_hide_cursor() -> bool`, `note_mouse_activity() -> void`; `component::post_load() override` initializes `controller::runtime`.

## Runtime

`post_load` skips on `no_controller`, constructs runtime (`DEBUG` true, otherwise false), calls `controller::engine::install`, schedules `engine_ready` after `100ms`, `frame` every `16ms`, and shutdown `keys().release_all()`. `runtime` is global `unique_ptr`; `REGISTER_COMPONENT` registers `component`.